			"notes": "New stuff:\nARMOR (at last)! Now your basic boring energized steel armor is no longer needing use, as we have made ALL tiers have armor! We have also fixed some stuff, such as some weird lang errors and more. Please, if you have any suggestions, go on [our discord](https://discord.gg/hnMmU5ba7z) or on the issues page.\n\nP.S.: We had to change the naming scheme to fix a bug with another mod. We now have our version title after the o, meaning:\npowah-2.3 = Powah version\no1.1 = Powah: Overcharged version\n\nThanks everyone, and we love the support the mod is getting.\nFrom:\nHellish Mods Team"
